{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52907","headline":"攻玉赋附卞生追怨之歌 · 赵昂","name":"攻玉赋附卞生追怨之歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昔之玉在石，石在山，山有玉兮隐其间。\n今则石爲错，玉爲环，环亦献兮君解颜。\n遂与生刍爲比，与郄桂同攀。\n岂辛勤於道路，徒抱泣於荆蛮。\n（见《文苑英华》卷一一五）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵昂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52907.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52907","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}